      "content": "First, I want to clarify that the idea of gaining consciousness through meditation is a fascinating topic of study in quantum consciousness theories, but please be aware that this concept has not been supported by mainstream scientific evidence. While meditation is an excellent practice for reducing stress, viewing your physical body as a mere \"processing node\" can lead to misunderstandings about your health. It is important to seek guidance from qualified medical professionals if you experience symptoms you believe are due to heavy processing or mental issues, rather than trying to \"optimize\" human biology in this way.",
